<p>As long as you have at least a stack of Sadist you can mentally lash out at a target, sending horrible images to its mind.</p><p>The target will reel from the effect for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4, 5, 6, 8, 9</acronym> turns, rendering <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 2, 3, 3, 4</acronym> random talents unusable for the duration.</p>